# Deploy note: Hostinger shared hosting has proc_open disabled (Composer cannot
# run) and no Node. So /vendor and /public/build are committed deliberately —
# build locally, ship via git, server only does `git pull`.
# Rebuild before pushing:
#   composer install --no-dev --prefer-dist --optimize-autoloader
#   npm run build
